{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-relatively-ample}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4bc275226b27c526d789ab912eb8d3121dc72f5d17286d48096e3497bd7a9131", "source_text": "Relatively ample sheaves", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cf5aa61656c8a14b89f2d9c36d72c4ef7e44ab5c1df2e21ef69b179e5b75ee77", "unit_id": "tag:01VG:title"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$X$", "MATH_0007": "$X$", "MATH_0008": "$X_s$", "MATH_0009": "$s \\in \\Gamma(X, \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes n})$", "MATH_0010": "$n \\geq 1$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-definition-ample}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e484e9e981e9617df5391dec8cb836bcfdb6cf41b159edb16124ab4b0b46eab5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:894aeca6d574a66aec42d270054b69b2728f2bd7985bc69b06b3dbacb160ad83", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme and <MATH_0002> an invertible sheaf on <MATH_0003>.\nThen <MATH_0004> is ample on <MATH_0005> if <MATH_0006> is quasi-compact and\nevery point of <MATH_0007> is contained in an affine open of the form\n<MATH_0008>, where <MATH_0009> and <MATH_0010>, see\nProperties, Definition <REF_0001>.\nWe turn this into a relative notion as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ecd1f1b2d20f68491802b679ad3c9c5ad0a2291852308fb887559435ac52aeaa", "unit_id": "tag:01VG:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{reference}\n\\cite[II Definition 4.6.1]{EGA}\n\\end{reference}", "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$X/S$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0009": "$V \\subset S$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0011": "$f^{-1}(V)$", "MATH_0012": "$X$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0004": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0004": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-relatively-ample}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:544ed462dae8acdae53ed093fb46bb021fa9286fe84f4649105df3331b476385", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d182e202f2e81ea9ab6318656b1ad073f7c7d9f0d873e3613143181ef24371cb", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an invertible <MATH_0003>-module.\nWe say <MATH_0004> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>relatively ample<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>, or <TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0005>-relatively ample<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>,\nor <TEXTITOPEN_0003>ample on <MATH_0006><TEXTITCLOSE_0003>, or <TEXTITOPEN_0004><MATH_0007>-ample<TEXTITCLOSE_0004> if <MATH_0008>\nis quasi-compact, and if for every affine open <MATH_0009>\nthe restriction of <MATH_0010> to the open subscheme\n<MATH_0011> of <MATH_0012> is ample.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6865b2ddc03ce59696d8d30851187877bc5edeade0c73b633df659697abb8629", "unit_id": "tag:01VH:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:392f6de93f42a636402e326f179b2e2943e99b83e8122d9fef878fbe330f930f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e404853d03b8e77afa13bf15df2e889b640e807a1a524d63e33ef62fd6dbc4bd", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe note that the existence of a relatively ample sheaf on <MATH_0001> does not\nforce the morphism <MATH_0002> to be of finite type.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0aa1b5165dbdb2b8913baa007b02f49d727e380939dbbc00a01c3235247f0f5b", "unit_id": "tag:01VG:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$n \\geq 1$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes n}$", "MATH_0008": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-ample-power-ample}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:36ae2257d5c56bc50842d93eb827f8bb8c300638b284a99d6169196ba96a5876", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b576dc7b83a798cb98ffa22eb0c593568d9c8f633300bf2dfc5e6ce03e460e05", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an invertible <MATH_0003>-module.\nLet <MATH_0004>. Then <MATH_0005> is <MATH_0006>-ample if and only if\n<MATH_0007> is <MATH_0008>-ample.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:135d0b5e51e57a6ce40e80f980c41a94ba18d01d0efb4de3d06ff63d48966d1a", "unit_id": "tag:02NN:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-lemma-ample-power-ample}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4b578eb1a29c5f5337184943f1144d13dffc9bac05159ab96033423f2fab0d6a", "source_text": "This follows from Properties, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7c9105b96f3a693d1878eb10be16377ddd52d68864296ac3411736b3ddeb295d", "unit_id": "tag:02NN:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-relatively-ample-separated}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:91f7f690005974538f9413d26e06567c7aaac53ad99387d497b14ae3e3c887e8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2f370ec470a2f96acf7caa7e543220253391d1df2991ff461454d1277ed76983", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nIf there exists an <MATH_0002>-ample invertible sheaf, then\n<MATH_0003> is separated.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1f1b1d8b7affe83d7635b92fd5a351f9ac2252916e28892a8260cfe7dd18ed9f", "unit_id": "tag:01VI:statement"}
